1 NOTE Clovis I
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=390d75f4-42dc-4bae-9c90-bc319834dc9c&tid=8764362&pid=-687674348
1 NOTE _P_CCINFO 2-2438
