2 CONT >>>>>ii)         [https://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000002512608885?through=6000000002512608885&from_flash=1&fsession_id=1532245262232 THEODEBALD] ([534]-555).  Gregory of Tours names Theodebald as the son of Theodebert and h
2 CONC is wife Deoteria, implying that he was born after his parents' marriage[82].  
