2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Frankish queen. She converted her husband, Clovis I, to Christianity and built with him in Paris the Church of the Apostles Peter and Paul, later renamed (10th cent.) Sainte-Geneviève. After her husband’s death she spent her life 
2 CONC caring for the poor. Feast: June 3.
