1 NOTE 1  NAME Clotair I "The Old" /Meroving/ 1  BIRT 2  DATE 499 2  PLAC Rheims, Marne, Loire-Atlantique, France 1  DEAT 2  DATE 561 1  DEAT 2  DATE 23 NOV 561 2  PLAC Braines, Loire-Atlantique, France
