2 CONC born about 438 in ThÃ¼ringen. She died in 470. She married Childerik I der Franken-59258 in 463/466.   Other marriages:  , Bisinus   They had the following children:     M i Clovis I 'de Grote' der Merovingen-59093 was born in 466
