1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.geni.com/people/M%C3%A9rovech-I-King-of-the-Salian-Franks/6000000002143186115?through=6000000005913253971 MEROVECH] (-[451/57]).  m ---.  The name of Merovech's wife is not known. Merovech is recorded 
2 CONC as having one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >1.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Child%C3%A9ric-I-King-of-the-Franks/6000000005913253971?through=6000000005913350166 CHILDERICH] (-Tournai [481/82], bur Tournai). 
2 CONT
2 CONT > m ([464]) as her second husband, [https://www.geni.com/people/Basina-II-of-the-Th%C3%BCringians/6000000003772264436?through=6000000005913350166 BASINA] King Childerich & his wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>a)         [https://www.geni.com/people/Clovis-I-the-Great-King-of-the-Franks/6000000005913350166?through=6000000005913253971 CHLODOVECH] [Clovis] ([464/67]-Paris [27 Nov] 511, bur Paris, basilique des Saints-Apôtres [later égli
2 CONC se de Sainte-Geneviève]).  
2 CONT
2 CONT >>b)         [https://www.geni.com/people/Lant%C3%A9childe/6000000003998835912?through=6000000005913253971 LANDECHILDIS] [Lantilde]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>c)         '''[https://www.geni.com/people/Audofledis-of-the-Salian-Franks/6000000002377207214?through=6000000005913253971 AUDOFLEDIS] . Iordanes records the marriage of Theodoric and "Lodoin Francorum regem filiam eius Audefled
2 CONC am" and names her brothers "Celdebertum et Heldebertum et Thiudebertum"[30], although this is presumably an incorrect reference to her nephews and great-nephew with similar names.  m ([492] ) THEODORIC King of the Ostrogoths in It
2 CONC aly, illegitimate son of THEODEMIR King of the Ostrogoths in Pannonia & his concubine Ereleuva -- ([454]-30 Aug 526). [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MEROVINGIANS.htm#ClovisIB MEDLANDS]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT >>d)        [https://www.geni.com/people/Albofl%C3%A8de/6000000047122259831?through=6000000005913253971 ALBOFLEDIS] (-after 496). 
2 CONT
