2 CONT Audofleda was the sister of Clovis who married Theodoric the Great, Kingof the Ostrogoths. Their daughter, Amalasuntha, was a foolish girl whomarried a slave named Traguilla. Audofleda, who wanted her to marry theson of a king, dr
2 CONC agged her home and married her to Eutheric. Audofledadied the same year as her husband, 526.
2 CONT
