1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Leo I the Thracian
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Reign	457 - 474
2 CONT
2 CONT Coronation	February 7, 457
2 CONT
2 CONT Full name	Flavius Valerius Leo
2 CONT
2 CONT Born	401
2 CONT
2 CONT Died	18 January 474 (aged 73)
2 CONT
