2 CONT Gertrud Prinsessan av Bayern <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> After the death of her first husband Theudebald, she married his great uncle and successor Clothair. <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> http://gw1.geneanet.org/
2 CONC henryknight?lang=no;p=waldrada;n=de+lombardia
