2 CONC ted "Attila the Hun" in 451.  One sou rce listed Merovaeus, K. of the Salic Franks as the son of another Merovaeus, the son of Clodius the Long-Haired, K. of the Salic F ranks. FILE: Colombia Encyclopedia (c) 1944; Peter Grard Gen
