1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There is some doubt about her identity. Eckhardt says that Chrodoald married about 610 an unknown daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Gisulfo-II-Duke-of-Friuli/6000000003827324432 Gisulf], a Lombard duke (''Mer
2 CONC owingerblut II: Agilolfinger und Etichonen'', 1965). However, Settipani suggests that Chrodoald's wife was Chlodosindis, a daughter of Siegbert I (''La prehistoire de Capetiens''). 
2 CONT
