2 CONC  wife "''amitam Theudeberti regis''"[48]." According to MedLands, her name is unknown. Her sister Chlodesindis married Authachar of the Lombards. See [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BAVARIA.htm#Chrodoald Chrodoald] and [http://fm
2 CONC g.ac/Projects/MedLands/MEROVINGIANS.htm#dauSigebertIMChrodoaldAgilolfinger Siegbert] at MedLands, visited Aug. 16, 2013.
