2 CONT *[361] Iohannis Abbatis Biclarensis Chronica [573], MGH Auct. ant. XI, p. 213. 
2 CONT *[362] Marii Episcopi Aventicensis Chronica 573, MGH Auct. ant. XI, p. 238. 
2 CONT *[363] Gregory of Tours IV.3, pp. 197-8. 
2 CONT *[364] Origo Gentis Langobardorum 5, MGH SS rer Lang I, p. 4. 
2 CONT *[365] Historia Langobardorum Codicis Gothani 5, MGH SS rer Lang I, p. 9. 
