2 CONT >He ['''Atanagildo''' (Atanagildus (Latin: At[h]anagildus; in Gothic: Aþanagilds; ?-Toledo, 567) married Flavia Juliana, daughter of Pedro Augusto, brother of the Byzantine emperor Mauricio; with her he had a son named Ardabasto, 
