2 CONT Beautiful, intelligent & utterly ruthless, Fredegunde had the necessary
2 CONT survival skills to live from 545 to 597, a good innings for the time. She was
2 CONT not having any rivals around & easily pursuaded Chilperic to have Galswintha
2 CONT strangled, to stop messing about and marry her, which he did.
