2 CONT
2 CONT Lewis, Archibald R. "The Dukes in the Regnum Francorum, A.D. 550–751." Speculum, Vol. 51, No 3 (July 1976), pp 381–410. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James, Edward. The Franks. (Peoples of Europe series) Basil Blackwell, 1988. ISBN 0-631-17936-4. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wallace-Hadrill, J. M. The Barbarian West. London: Hutchinson, 1970. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wallace-Hadrill, J. M. The Long-Haired Kings. London: Butler & tanner Ltd, 1962. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Collins, Roger. Early Medieval Europe 300–1000. London: MacMillan, 1991. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Murray, Archibald C. and Goffart, Walter A. After Rome's Fall: Narrators and Sources of Early Medieval History. 1999. 
2 CONT
