1 NOTE Chlotarius II 'de Grote' der Merovingen-59236 [Parents] was born in 584. He died on 4 Jan 629. He married Bertrude-64335.   Other marriages:  , Haldetrude , Sichilda
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT http://www.american-pictures.com/genealogy/persons/per03536.htm#0
