1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''EUTHARICH''' (-[522/23]) FLAVIUS EUTHARICUS CILLIGA
2 CONT s/o VETERICUS
2 CONT x (515) AMALASUINTHA, d/o THEODORIC King of the Ostrogoths in Italy & Audofledis of the Franks ([493]-murdered [30 Apr] 535)
2 CONT *ATHALARIC ([517/18]-2 Oct 534) King of Italy
2 CONT *MATASUNTHA [Mathesuentha] ([518]-) x  (end 536)  VITIGIS King of Italy (-542) xx (542) GERMANUS, nephew of Emperor JUSTINIAN (-[551])
