2 CONT ===Genealogy 
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/THURINGIA.htm#dauMAudouinLombards
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         HERMANFRED (-Zülpich 534).  Gregory of Tours names Baderic, Hermanfrid and Berthar as three brothers ruling over the Thuringians[14].  … m [510] AMALABERGA, daughter of [HUGA rex Francorum] & his wife Amalafrida the Ost
2 CONC rogoth . King Hermanfred & his wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT * a)         '''two sons''' .  The Liber Historiæ Francorum records that "[https://www.geni.com/people/Theoderich-I-King-of-Metz/6000000172631298845 Theudericus] et Theudobertus filius eius et Chlotharius rex" invaded Thuringia an
2 CONC d attacked "Ermenfredum regem Toringorum", a marginal addition recording that "Teodericus filius Clodovei ex concubina" threw "Ermenfridum regem" from a wall and '''killed his two sons'''[23].  
2 CONT * b)         AMALAFRIDAS .  Procopius records that "Amalafridus, vir Gotthus, ex filia nepos Amalafridæ sororis Theoderici Gotthorum regis et filius Hermenefridi regis Thoringorum” was deported to Byzantium with Vitigis King of It
2 CONC aly by Belisarius (in 540)[24].  
2 CONT * c)         daughter .  Procopius records that "Amalafridus, vir Gotthus, ex filia nepos Amalafridæ sororis Theoderici Gotthorum regis et filius Hermenefridi regis Thoringorum…sororem eius” married "Anduino Langobardorum regi"[25
2 CONC ].  The Codex Theodosianus records that the daughter of Amalaberga became the second wife of King Audoin[26].  m as his second wife, AUDOIN King of the Lombards, son of ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [23] Liber Historiæ Francorum 22, MGH SS rer Merov II, p. 277
