1 NOTE SOME SOURCES SAY CHILPERIC'S PARENTS WERE GUNDIOC (L (NOTES) BURGONDES KI NG OF BURGUNDY AND CARATENE (L) (NOTES) WALIA DE BURGUNDY.
2 CONT
2 CONT AS OTHER SOURCES SHOW CARATENE AS CHILPERIC'S WIFE,  I SHOW  SHOW CARATE NE (L) (NOTES) WALIA DE BURGUNDY AS THE WIFE  OF CHILPERIC BUT NOT AS H IS MOTHER HERE.
2 CONT
2 CONT I SHOW HIS MOTHER AS UNKNOWN.
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER POSSIBLE PARENTS ARE SHOWN BELOW BUT THIS INDIVIDUAL IS NOT SHO WN AS A CHILD ON THE FOLLOWING POSSIBLE PARENTS' FAMILY PAGES,  TO DO SO W OULD BE  CONSIDERED ERRORS BY THIS PROGRAM.  EVEN THOUGH THESE LAST POSSIB LE PARENTS
2 CONC  MAY BE THE CORRECT ONES, SHOWING MORE THAN ONE SET OF PARENTS C OULD CAUSE MY "FAMILY TREE" PROGRAM TO MALFUNCTION.
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER SOURCES SAY HIS MOTHER WAS CLOTHILDE (NOTES) (L) DES WISIGOTHS  ANOT HER OF HIS FATHER CUNDIOC'S WIVES.
2 CONT
2 CONT STILL OTHER SOURCES SAY HIS FATHER WAS CHILDERIC I (NOTES) KING FRANKS ( L) FRANCE AND HIS MOTHER WAS BASINA (NOTES) ANDOVERA (L) DE THURINGIA
