2 CONT Aspar was an emperor maker as well as a patrician and magister militum of the eastern empire.
2 CONT He fought with his father also a magister militum under Theodosius II, in 421 during the Persian wars. They invaded Arzanene and Mesopotania where they defeated seven Persian Generals.
