2 CONT '''Gunther''' ('''Gundahar''', '''Gundahari''', Latin '''Gundaharius''', '''Gundicharius''', or '''Guntharius''', Old English '''Gūðhere''', Old Norse '''Gunnarr''', anglicised as '''Gunnar''', d. 437) was a historical King of Bur
2 CONC gundy in the early 5th century. Legendary tales about him appear in Latin, medieval Middle High German, Old Norse, and Old English texts, especially concerning his relations with Siegfried (Sigurd in Old Norse) and his death by tr
2 CONC eachery in the hall of Attila the Hun.
