2 CONT 3.   SIEGBERT the Lame, King of Cologne; crippled in a battle at Tolbiac (Zulpich); murdered 509 in his tent in the Buconian Forest by order of his ambitious son, CLODERIC at the instigation of their kinsman CLOVIS the Great.
