1 NOTE SOME SOURCES SAY CARATENE'S PARENTS WERE CHIEF OF THE SEUVICS (L) SUEVI A ND DAUGHTER (NOTES) OF WALIA OF THE (L) VISIGOTHS AND THAT HER MATERNAL GR ANDPARENTS WERE WALIA VALIA OR WALLIA (NOTES) KING (L) VISIGOTHS AND HROTH ILDIS 
2 CONC (NOTES) OF THE (L) WEST GOTHS
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER POSSIBLE PARENTS ARE SHOWN BELOW BUT THIS INDIVIDUAL IS NOT SHO WN AS A CHILD ON THE FOLLOWING POSSIBLE PARENTS' FAMILY PAGES, TO DO SO WO ULD BE CONSIDERED ERRORS BY THIS PROGRAM.  EVEN THOUGH THESE LAST POSSIB LE PARENTS M
2 CONC AY BE THE CORRECT ONES, SHOWING MORE THAN ONE SET OF PARENTS C OULD CAUSE MY "FAMILY TREE" PROGRAM TO MALFUNCTION.
