2 CONT OTHER SOURCES SAY HER PARENTS WERE HER MATERNAL GRANDPARENTS ABOVE, WAL IA VALIA OR WALLIA (NOTES) KING (L) VISIGOTHS AND HROTHILDIS (NOTES) OF T HE (L) WEST GOTHS
2 CONT
2 CONT STILL OTHER SOURCES SAY HER PARENTS WERE RECHIARE (NOTES) (L) DE SUEVIE A ND WALLIA (NOTES) (L) DE WISGOTHIE.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALSO, SOME SOURCES SHOW, AND IT'S SHOWN THAT WAY HERE, THAT CARATENE (NOTE S) OF THE (L) SUEVI AND HER HUSBAND RICIMER FLAVIUS (NOTES) GENERAL (L) RO MAN EMPIRE WERE HALF BROTHER AND SISTER WITH DIFFERENT FATHERS BUT THE SA ME MOT
2 CONC HER DAUGHTER OF WALIA OF THE (L) VISIGOTHS.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALSO, SOME SOURCES SAY  GONDOBALD (NOTES) BURGONDES (L) DE BURGUNDY (SHO WN AS CARATENE'S SON WITH GUNDIOC (NOTES) BURGONDES KING OF (L) BURGUNDY H ERE) WAS THE HUSBAND (NOTE THE SON) OF CARATENE (NOTES) OF THE (L) SUE VI  AND WIT
2 CONC H HER THE FATHER OF GODOGISEL (NOTES) DE BURGONDES KING (L) GEN EVA (SHOWN AS HER SON WITH GUNDIOC (NOTES) BURGONDES KING OF (L) BURGUN DY HERE).
2 CONT
2 CONT CARATENE WAS THE MOTHER OF CARATENE (NOTES) WALIA (L) DE BURGUNDY AND OF R EGANABURGA (NOTES) BURGUNDY (L) DE BOURGONDIE (SHOWN AS HER GRANDDAUGHT ER HERE) BUT SHE IS NOT SHOWN SO HERE BECAUSE SHOWING MORE THAN ONE S ET OF PARENTS
2 CONC  COULD CAUSE MY "FAMILY TREE" PROGRAM TO MALFUNCTION.
2 CONT
2 CONT PROBABLY ONLY ONE OF THE TWO CARATENE'S, POSSIBLE  MOTHER CARATENE (NOTE S) OF THE (L) SUEVI AND DAUGHTER CARATENE (NOTES) WALIA (L) DE BURGUNDY, W ERE ACTUALLY THE WIFE OF GUNDIOC (NOTES) BURGONDES KING OF (L) BURGUND Y.  BUT WHI
2 CONC CH ONE?
2 CONT
2 CONT THIS IS ALL VERY CONFUSING.  THERE HAVE GOT TO BE ERRORS HERE BUT WHAT'S R IGHT?
2 CONT
2 CONT TO MAKE IT EVEN MORE CONFUSING, SOME SOURCES SHOW HROTHILDIS (NOTES) (L) D ES WISIGOTHS AS THE WIFE OF GUNDIOC (NOTES) BURGONDES KING OF (L) BURGUN DY AS IS CARATENE (NOTES) OF THE (L) SUEVI (SHOWN AS HER NIECE HERE) AND W ITH GUN
2 CONC DIOC THE MOTHER OF GONDOBALD (NOTES) BURGONDES (L) DE BURGUNDY SHO WN HER AS THE SON OF  GUNDIOC (NOTES) BURGONDES KING OF (L) BURGUN DY AS IS CARATENE (NOTES) OF THE (L) SUEVI (BUT IN SOME CASES AS THE WI FE OF CARATENE NOT HER S
2 CONC ON).
2 CONT
2 CONT CONFUSING?  THERE MUST BE ERRORS HERE BUT I SHOW IT HERE AS MOST SOURCES S EEMS TO.
