2 CONT Page 67:
2 CONT
2 CONT 10.  DAGOBERT II, alive 656-79, King of Austrasia, was very young when his father died.  The mayor Brimoald arranged for the boy's exile to Ireland, which lasted 20 years, during which little is recorded about the Austrasian kingd
2 CONC om.  He was brought back in 676 only to be murdered three years later.  Here we part company with the Merovingian Dynasty, which continued to reign in name only until 751.  Our descent continues through the female line.
2 CONT
2 CONT !Availability: The libraries of Ken, Karen, Kristen, Kevin, Brian, Amy, Adam and FAL.
