1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''BILICHILDIS (-murdered forest of Lognes, Chelles c18 Oct/10 Nov 675, bur Paris, Saint-Germain-des-Prés)
2 CONT poss. d/o SIGEBERT III  & Chimnechildis'''
2 CONT x c664/6 Sep 667 CHILDERICH II King o/t Franks s/o CLOVIS II King of the Franks & Bathildis (-murdered forest of Lognes, near Chelles [18 Oct/10 Nov] 675, bur Paris, Saint-Germain-des-Prés)] 
2 CONT * DAGOBERT (-murdered forest of Lognes, near Chelles [18 Oct/10 Nov] 675, bur Paris, Saint-Germain-des-Prés)
