1 NOTE {geni:about_me} CHLODOVECH [Clovis], son of DAGOBERT I King of the Franks & his second wife Nantechildis (633-[Oct/Nov] 657).   He succeeded his father in [638/39] as CLOVIS II King of the Franks in Neustria, under the regency of 
2 CONC his mother and maior domus Aega. 
