2 CONT * Thompson, Romans and Barbarians, 150
2 CONT * Kulikowski, Late Roman Spain and its Cities, 156–157
2 CONT * Burgess, The Chronicle of Hydatius, 81
2 CONT * Thompson, Romans and Barbarians, 153
2 CONT * Burgess, The Chronicle of Hydatius,83
2 CONT * Thompson, Romans and Barbarians,154
2 CONT * Burgess, The Chronicle of Hydatius, 83
2 CONT * Burgess, The Chronicle of Hydatius, 83
