2 CONT ==Wallia, king of the Visigoths 
2 CONT * Reign: 415–418
2 CONT *Predecessor: [https://www.geni.com/people/Sigeric-king-of-the-Visigoths/6000000205081304926 Sigeric]
2 CONT * Successor: [https://www.geni.com/people/Theodoric-I-king-of-the-Visigoths/6000000010646052427 Theodoric I]
2 CONT *Died: 418
2 CONT *Dynasty: [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balti_dynasty Balti dynasty]
2 CONT * Spouse: possibly [https://www.geni.com/people/Unknown-possible-but-unlikely-Daughter-of-Flavius-Richomeres/6000000051825195479?through=6000000003645870055 a daughter of Richomer]
2 CONT * Daughter: [https://www.geni.com/people/Princess-of-the-Visigoths-N-N/6000000012044189072?through=6000000003645870055 mother] of [https://www.geni.com/people/Ricimer/6000000006602664678?through=6000000012044189072 Ricimer] and th
2 CONC e mother-in-law of [https://www.geni.com/people/Gunderic-King-of-the-Burgundians/5129459882500045150?through=6000000023207434248 Gundowech, King of the Burgundians]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
