1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.geni.com/people/Probus/6000000003645870269 the husband of, https://www.geni.com/people/Flavia-Proba/6000000003645870275 is only known to us as a name from Nikephorus's chronicle. See https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/discussions/265167?msg=1632160
2 CONT
2 CONT Settipani theorizes that Probus could have been a relative of his wife, perhaps through her father or maybe a descendent of https://www.geni.com/people/Flavius-Probus/6000000000317238768, Olybrius. Perhaps he was the same as the P
2 CONC robus who served as consol in 525.
2 CONT
