2 CONT      Wulfhere, King of Mercia was the son of Penda, King of Mercia and Cynewise (?). (1), (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 675. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wulfhere, King of Mercia gained the title of King Wulfhere of Mercia in 658. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Wulfhere, King of Mercia
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Cenred, King of Mercia d. c 709 (1)
