2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Arthemia and Munderic of Vitry-en-Perthois
2 CONT
2 CONT Saint Gondoule Governor of Marseilles, Mayor of the Palace, and Bishop of Tongres+ (524 - 6 Jul 607)1,2,4 
2 CONT
