2 CONT
2 CONT     * DEATH: ABT 0715 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Childebert III*
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Habibai* NATRONAI
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 :
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. +Theuderic IV* OF NEUSTRIA 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.afn.org/~lawson/d0000/g0000007.html#I8434
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Born in Franksih Kingdom and passed in France
