1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Richemir, Duke of the Burgundians & Franconians'''. He was Patrician of the Burgundians, and Duke in Franconia and Burgundy. Said on unknown authority to have been a son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Betton-cou
2 CONC nt-of-Orl%C3%A9ans/6000000000641960382 Betton d'Orléans], who was also duke in Franconia and Burgundy, and his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Austregilde-d-A%C3%AFga-d-Orl%C3%A9ans/6000000000700917198 Austregild].
