2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austrasia
2 CONT
2 CONT "Austrasia was the original territory of the Frankish tribes prior to their unification under Clovis I, centred on the Middle Rhine and the Moselle. It became a separate kingdom ruled under Sigebert I within the Frankish Empire in
2 CONC  567, and it eventually lost its territorial character in the Carolingian Empire in the 8th century."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.google.com/maps/place/Lomme,+Lille,+France/@50.6432683,2.9608049,13z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x47c2d557b14c6403:0x260af13f80091761
2 CONT
2 CONT "Lomme was a town in the Nord département of northern France. It was absorbed as a commune associée by the city of Lille in 2000." ----
