1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ingelram de Lions (bef1020-) .
2 CONT
2 CONT Heinrich Comte de Louvain et de Bruxelles Male 0997–1038
2 CONT
2 CONT Mathilde von Lothringen Female 0994–1060
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings
2 CONT
2 CONT Godfried van Leuven Male 1014–Deceased
2 CONT
2 CONT When Heinrich Comte de Louvain et de Bruxelles was born in 0997, in Leuven, Brabant, Belgium, his father, Lambert I. Graf von Löwen, was 47 and his mother, Gerberge von Nieder-Lothringen, was 22. He married Mathilde von Lothringen
2 CONC  about 1015, in Lorraine, Holy Roman Empire. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 1 daughter. He died on 5 August 1038, in his hometown, at the age of 41.
