1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography==
2 CONT In 1091, said to have ridden with Atheling to depose Donald Bain and rescue King Edgar.  In recognition of above service, said to have been given lands in Perthshire (Glen Lyon).
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger de Leonne was born 1040 in France to Ingelram de Lions (bef1020-) .
