1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BOURBON.htm#BeatrixMBeraudMercoeur
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.         BEATRIX  [Agnès] de Bourbon .  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by the testament of her brother "Archenbaudus dominus Borbonensis", dated Aug 1248, which appoints "…dominum Beraudum de Mercolio sororium meum…" a
2 CONC s his executors[151].  1281.  
2 CONT
