2 CONT
2 CONT Married:   to Marguerite of Dampierre ( -1387)      
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:  Maurice VII of Craon ( -1330)     **     Pierre I de Craon (bef. 1328-1376)     **     Jeanne de Craon (1315- )      
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:  Beatrice of Craon (c. 1335-1376)     **     Marie de Craon (c. 1350-1401)     **     Pierre of Craon-Sainte-Maure (1345- )     **     Jean I de Craon ( -1408)     **     Guillaume de Craon (c. 1340-aft. 1407)      
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes:  Viscount of Chateaudun. 
