2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Janvre, "noble écuyer," sgr. de La Bouchetière and Veuzé'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''XIV. Jean Janvre, "noble écuyer," sgr. de La Bouchetière and Veuzé, married 26 jan. 1355, Dlle. Marie de Rogre, daur. of Guillaume de Rogre, chev., sgr. de Rouvre, near Cherveux, and of Jeanne Poupart. He is known in various dee
2 CONC ds and charters of 14 Aug. 1381, 1386, 26 Oct. 1389, 1390. He left: (a) Jean, who succeeds, XV·; (b) Perrot, d. s.p., 13 Oct. 1436.'' 
2 CONT
2 CONT REF: All Huguenot Pedigrees, Vol. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.co.za/books?id=ZPtpj7KhjwkC&pg=PA45&lpg=PA45&dq=Archambaud+Janvre,+sgr.&source=bl&ots=MdS_hfo25Q&sig=oCaMY5RaYghSlFdvwwa9oGr-RtU&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjo6NG-yfnUAhWsI8AKHXLdBPgQ6AEILTAD#v=onepage&q=Archambaud%
