2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Many secondary sources state that Beatrice married, as her second husband, Guy [II] Seigneur de Bâgé (see BURGUNDY DUCHY NOBILITY). ''' Guichenon, in his Histoire de Savoie, explains the background to this error, recording tha
2 CONC t "Pingon, du Buttet, du Chesne et les sainte Marthe…moi après eux" confused the name "Dauphine", under which Guy´s widow is recorded with the title "Dauphine [de Viennois]"[198], the widow of André Comte d´Albon being the only av
2 CONC ailable person with that title.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Moreri, Le grand dictionnaire historique: ou le mélange curieux..., Volume 1 (Basel: 1731) p 112
