2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT
2 CONT He first married Sybille of Bage and had 8 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Bonne of Savoy, married John I of Viennois, dauphin of Viennois and Hugh of Burgundy, lord of Montbauson
2 CONT
2 CONT John of Savoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrice of Savoy, married Manfred III of Saluzzo
2 CONT
2 CONT Edoardo
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleonor of Savoy, married William of Chalon, count of Auxerre and Tonnerre, Dreux IV of Mello and John I, count Forez - their children included Marguerite of Mello, who married John II of Chalon-Arlay
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of Savoy, d. 1349, married to John I of Montferrat
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes of Savoy, d. 1372, married to William III of Geneva
2 CONT
2 CONT Aimone
