1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://archive.org/stream/nobiliaireuniver16sainuoft#page/274/mode/2up
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Janvre, sgr. de La Bouchetière'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''XV. Jean Janvre, sgr. de La Bouchetière, married, 26 Oct. 1389, Dlle. Marguerite Chenin, daur. of Gauvin (d. at that date), chev., sgr. de l'Isle Bapaume. Jean Janvre was living 9 Ap. 1409 and left: (a) Jean, who succeeds, XVI,;
2 CONC  (b) Philippe, wife of Jean Sergente; (c) Marguerite, married before 1436, Louis Corignon; (at) Jeanne, married before 1436, Alain Leschatté; (e) Catherine: all mentioned in a deed of partition, 13 Oct. 1436.''
2 CONT
2 CONT REF: All Huguenot Pedigrees, Vol. 1 
2 CONT
