2 CONC rcourt & his wife Catherine de Bourbon (Harcourt 11 Apr 1377-).  Jean [II] & his wife had children:  i)          LOUIS d’Estouteville (-21 Aug 1464)).  Seigneur d’Estouteville, de Vallemont et de Hotot.  Grand bouteiller de France
2 CONC .  -         see below.  ii)         GUILLAUME d’Estouteville (-Rome 22 Dec 1483, bur Rome St. Augustine’s convent).  Archbishop of Rouen.  Cardinal. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         GUILLAUME d’Estouteville (-after 1394).  Bishop of Evreux.  
2 CONT
2 CONT c)         ISABELLE d’Estouteville (-after 28 Oct 1438).  Her parentage and second marriage are confirmed by the following document: [her son] “Robert de Bethune chevalier seigneur de Marueil en Brie, d’Hostel et de Baye” and “mad
