1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''MARIE de Craon (-<Oct 1415, bur Buzay abbey)'''
2 CONT d/o JEAN de Craon Seigneur de la Suze & Beatrix de Rochefort 
2 CONT x < 5 Feb 1404 GUY de Laval (-[29 Oct 1415/early 1416], bur Buzay abbey) s/o  GUY de Laval “Brumor” Seigneur de Chaloyau & Typhinia de Husson Dame de Ducey 
2 CONT *GILLES de Laval ([1404/05]-killed Nantes 24 Oct 1440). Seigneur de Rays x CATHERINE de Thouars
2 CONT *RENE de Laval (-1474). Seigneur de la Suze.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/anjounob.htm#MarieCraonMGuyLaval
2 CONT ----
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Guy-II-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Rais/6000000014329892239?through=6000000014329624719 GUY de Laval], son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Guy-I-de-Montmorency-Laval-seigneur-de-Challouyau/6000000014
2 CONC 329834410?through=6000000014329892239  GUY de Laval “Brumor” Seigneur de Chaloyau] & his second wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Tiphaine-de-Husson/6000000032281754945?through=6000000014329892239  Typhinia de Husson Dame de Ducey
2 CONC ] (-[29 Oct 1415/early 1416], bur Buzay abbey). Duchesne records his parentage, and that in 1400 “Jeanne Dame de Raiz dite la Sage” declared him “son vray et legitime heritier, comme descendu de Jeanne de Raiz surnommée la Folle, 
2 CONC et de Foulques de Laval son second mary; à condition qu’il prendront le nom et les Armes de Raiz”, which he accepted 29 Sep 1401, but that Jeanne Chabot Dame de Retz changed her mind and 14 May 1402 appointed “Catherine de Macheco
2 CONC ul sa cousine Dame de la Suse et de la Benaste” as her heir, which later resulted in “un grand different entre Guy de Laval et Jean de Craon Seigneur de Champtocé et d’Ingrande fils de Catherine”, settled by Guy’s marriage with Je
2 CONC an de Craon’s daughter (no source citations)[364].  A charter of Guy de Laval dated 3 May 1406 records the arrangements for the marriage of “Jehanne de Meullent, fille de Raoul de Meullent et Tiphaigne de Huchon, seur de mère dudi
2 CONC ct de Laval, sgr de Dussey” and “Guillaume de Briqueville, sr de Laulne”, noting the dowry “cent livres torunois de rente...que ladite Jehanne eust peu demander audit Guy...des successions de ladite Tiphaigne et Guillaume de Hucho
2 CONC n”, given by “ledit Guy de Laval”[365].  Europäische Stammtafeln records his testament 28/29 Oct 1415 and his place of burial[366].  The testament of "Guy de Laval-Retz”, dated 28/29 Oct 1415, chose burial “à Buzay auprès de Marie
2 CONC  de Craon son épouse”, named “Jean de Tournemine sieur de la Hunaudaye époux de Jeanne de Saffré pour tuteur de ses fils”[367].  Duchesne records his death “avant l’an 1416”[368]. ''' m (before 5 Feb 1404) [https://www.geni.com/pe
2 CONC ople/Marie-de-Craon/6000000014329642592   MARIE de Craon], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Jean-de-Craon-Dommart-en-Ponthieu-de-Nou%C3%A2tre/6000000003827587630?through=6000000014329642592 JEAN de Craon Seigneur de la Suz
2 CONC e] & his first wife [https://www.geni.com/people/B%C3%A9atrix-de-Rochefort/6000000014329901294?through=6000000003827587630 Beatrix de Rochefort] (-before Oct 1415, bur Buzay abbey).  The 28/29 Oct 1415 testament of her husband con
2 CONC firms that she predeceased her husband and records her burial at Buzay. ''' Guy & his wife had two children:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Gilles-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Rais/6000000014329624719 GILLES de Lava]l ([1404/05]-killed Nantes 24 Oct 1440).  Seigneur de Rays
2 CONT m (contract 30 Nov 1420) as her first husband, [https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-de-Thouars/6000000014329885763?through=6000000014329624719 CATHERINE de Thouars], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Milon-de-Thouars-de-P
2 CONC ouzanges-Tiffauges/6000000014329611804?through=6000000014329885763 MILON [II] de Thouars Seigneur de Pouzauges] & his wife --- (-2 Dec 1462).  
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Ren%C3%A9-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Retz/6000000016700527962?through=6000000014329624719 RENE de Laval] (-1474) m ANNE de Champagne, daughter of --- (-1501).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/mainnob.htm#GillesLaval
2 CONT ----
