1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p3053.htm#i91711 '''Randon II de Joyeuse, Baron de Joyeuse''']
2 CONT
2 CONT Randon II de Chateauneuf, Baron de Joyeuse, 
2 CONT * Father - Louis I de Chateauneuf, Baron de Joyeuse1 d. a 1395
2 CONT * Mother	- Tiburge de St. Didier1 d. a 1395
2 CONT * Randon II de Chateauneuf, Baron de Joyeuse married Catherine Aubert de Monteil, daughter of Etienne Aubert, Seigneur de la Rochedagu & Montel and Marie de Chaslus. 
2 CONT * Randon II de Chateauneuf, Baron de Joyeuse died after 1424.
2 CONT ===Family===
2 CONT * Catherine Aubert de Monteil
2 CONT ===Children	===
2 CONT  *  Louis II de Chateauneuf, Vicomte de Joyeuse
2 CONT * Jean de Joyeuse
2 CONT
