1 NAME Jean Janvre, sgr. de La Bouchetière and Chauvellière
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 'https://archive.org/stream/nobiliaireuniver16sainuoft#page/274/mode/2up
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Jean Janvre, sgr. de La Bouchetière and Chauvellière'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''XVI. Jean Janvre, 6th of the name, sgr. de La Bouchetière and Chauvellière; married, 21 Jan. 1410, Dlle. Thomasse Corignolle (Corignon), daur. of Haubert Corignon, chev., sgr. du Vivier-Estraing, in Angoumois, sister of Louis Co
2 CONC rignon, above. Jean Janvre qualifies as "haut et puissant" in deeds of 26 July 1432, 8 Aug. 1435, 16 Dec. 1439, 28 May 1450, 27 May 1456. He left: (a) Mathurin, who succeeds, XVII.; (b) André, d. before 15 June 1440; (c) Isabeau, 
2 CONC married, before 15 June 1440, Mathurin Rour-theau, éc.; (d) N .... Janvre, wife of Anthoine Chevallier, éc.'' 
2 CONT
2 CONT REF: All Huguenot Pedigrees, Vol. 1
