1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genobco.free.fr/provence/FlotteRoquevaire.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT >The Flotte-Roquevaire are a branch of the illustrious house of Flotte known from the tenth century in Gapençais, allied with the counts of Forcalquier in the 12th century and which had many ramifications in Provence and Dauphiné.
2 CONC  According to the high-alpine historian Joseph Roman, who published a genealogy of the first Flotte (Gen. of the Flotte family, Bull Soc. And. Hautes-Alpes, 1904) established after Chérin but without criticism and therefore to be 
2 CONC taken with caution, recalls J. Grosdidier de Matons, the filiation would be followed since Arnaud Flotte, witness of a treaty between the Bishop of Gap and the Count of Provence in 1044.<BR>
2 CONT
2 CONT >The branch of Roquevaire came out of that of the Roche-des-Arnauds and Jarjayes, by Arnaud Flotte co-lord of Jarjayes, who married around the middle of the thirteenth century Mabile de Roquevaire whose family, the Auriol, had bui
2 CONC lt a century earlier the castrum of Roquevaire and bore its name (Albanès, Roquevaire, its origins, its lords, 1881). Bertrand Flotte, son of Arnaud, however, inherited from his mother only commons's property in Roquevaire and not
2 CONC  the main seigneury which, with the castle, remained to his great-uncle Audebert de Roquevaire and then to his son Pelet de Mimet, before being ceded to Pope Urban V (1364) and later to the Cabre. Bertrand Flotte tested on May 12,
2 CONC  1316. His posterity in Roquevaire, without great income, could not maintain his state and derogated, the elders going to settle in Marseille.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genobco.free.fr/provence/FlotteRoquevaire.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT I - Arnaud FLOTTE knight, co-lord of Jarjayes, wife Mabile de ROQUEVAIRE daughter and heiress of Hugues d'AURIOL lord of Roquevaire, and Raymonde de MARSEILLE. She is buried at the tomb of the chapel of Notre-Dame de la Lause in R
2 CONC oquevaire. From where:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Bertrand who follows,
2 CONT # Adalasie or Alayone FLOTTE marries Hugues BLANC damoiseau.
2 CONT # Hugues de GIGNAC
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Généalogie
2 CONT
2 CONT http://jean.gallian.free.fr/comm2/f/flotte-roquevaire.html
2 CONT
2 CONT * V. Arnaud de Flotte x Mabille d'Auriol de Roquevaire, fille d'Hugues, sg de Gignac & de Béatrix de Fos  d'où les FLOTTE de ROQUEVAIRE :
2 CONT ** VI. Bertrand de Flotte, sg de La Roche Cabre et de Roquevaire  x Millette de Fos
2 CONT *** VII. François de Flotte, sg de La Roche Cabre et de Roquevaire x1 Ne x2 Osacique de Jarjaye
2 CONT **** Du premier mariage : VIII. Hugues de La Roche Cabre 
2 CONT **** Du second mariage VIII. Bertrand de Flotte 1366 Roquevaire (13) x Ne
2 CONT *****IX. Estienne de Flotte ° Roquevaire x Delphine N
2 CONT ****** X. Jean de Flotte ° 1452 Roquevaire, sg de Roquevaire x Catherine N
2 CONT ******* XI. Albert de Flotte ° Roquevaire x 13/4/1468 Aubagne Marguerite de Jean, fille d'Antoine & de Jaumette Bourges
2 CONT ******** XII. Jaumette de Flotte, ° 1452 Roquevaire x 17/2/1510 à Auriol (13), Brancay Maurin 1485, fils d'Antoine
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * http://racineshistoire.free.fr/LGN/PDF/Flote.pdf Page 16 group 3
