2 CONC ed]
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. ^ Halecki, Oskar (1978). A history of Poland. Routledge. ISBN 0710086474. [page needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. ^ Parsons, John Carmi (1997). Medieval Queenship. Palgrave Macmillan. ISBN 0312172982. [page needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. ^ Richard II: The Art of Kingship. Oxford University Press. 2003. ISBN 0199262209. [page needed]
2 CONT
