1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.geni.com/people/Guy-II-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Rais/6000000014329892239?through=6000000014329624719 GUY de Laval], son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Guy-I-de-Montmorency-Laval-seigneur-de-Chall
2 CONC ouyau/6000000014329834410?through=6000000014329892239  GUY de Laval “Brumor” Seigneur de Chaloyau] & his second wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Tiphaine-de-Husson/6000000032281754945?through=6000000014329892239  Typhinia de Huss
2 CONC on Dame de Ducey] (-[29 Oct 1415/early 1416], bur Buzay abbey).Guy & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Gilles-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Rais/6000000014329624719 GILLES de Lava]l ([1404/05]-killed Nantes 24 Oct 1440).  Seigneur de Rays. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         '''[https://www.geni.com/people/Ren%C3%A9-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Retz/6000000016700527962?through=6000000014329624719 RENE de Laval] (-1474).  Seigneur de la Suze. "Messire René de Rays chevalier” requested “mess
2 CONC ire Gilles de Rays baron et seigneur de Rays, frère aisné dudit René, enfans de feu Guy en son vivant seigneur de Rays et de feue Marie de Craon fille de feu messire Jehan de Craon jadis chevalier en son vivant seigneur de la Suze
2 CONC  et de Champtocé et de dame Béatrix de Rochefort sa femme” to finalise the division of their inheritance between them by charter dated 25 Jan 1433 (O.S.), reserving the dower of “dame Anne de Sillé veusve dudit feu seigneur de la 
2 CONC Suze”[372].  Seigneur de Rays.  m ANNE de Champagne, daughter of --- (-1501).  René & his wife had one child:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         JEANNE de Laval .  m FRANÇOIS de Chauvigny Seigneur de Châteauroux, Vicomte de Brosse, son of GUY [III] de Chauvigny Seigneur de Châteauroux, Vicomte de Brosse & his wife Catherine de Laval (-15 May 1490). 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/mainnob.htm#GillesLaval
2 CONT ----
