2 CONT '''     Charles I de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon was born in 1401.2 He was the son''' of Jean I de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon and Marie de Berry.2 '''He married Agnes de Bourgogne''', daughter of Jean I de Valois, Duc de Bourgogne and Ma
2 CONC rguerite von Bayern-Straubing, '''in 1425 at Autun, FranceG.2 He died on 4 December 1456 at Chateau de Moulins'''G.
2 CONT '''     He gained the title of Duc de Bourbon in 1434.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of Charles I de Bourbon, Duc de Bourbon and Agnes de Bourgogne'''
