1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SAVOY.htm#UrbanLaChambredied1415B
2 CONT
2 CONT URBAIN de la Chambre, son of JEAN [III] Seigneur de la Chambre, Vicomte de Maurienne & his first wife Jeanne de Chalon (-[31 Aug 1440/30 Jun 1445]).  Vicomte de Maurienne.  Urban swore homage to the Comte de Savoie “comme l’avait 
2 CONC son père en 1415” by charter dated 26 Oct 1428[1063].  His testaments, dated 1 Feb 1435 and 31 Aug 1440, named his son Gaspard as universal heir, substituting “Aymon de Seyssel son petit-fils”[1064].  Foras records that he died be
2 CONC fore 30 Jun 1445[1065]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly LOUISE Dame de Sagone, daughter of ---.  Foras records her marriage (no sources cited)[1066]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly AIMEE de Corgenon Dame de Meillonnas en Bresse, daughter of ---.  Foras records her family origin and marriage (no sources cited)[1067]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' thirdly MARGUERITE de Chalancon, daughter of PIERRE Armand de Chalancon Vicomte de Polignac & his wife Marguerite de Saligny.  Foras records her parentage and marriage (no sources cited)[1068]. 
