1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SAVOY.htm#MargueriteLaChambreMJeanSeyssel
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.         MARGUERITE de la Chambre (-[13 Jul 1437/1438], bur La Rochette).  The testament of Jean de la Chambre, dated 29 Sep 1429, bequeathed property to “son père et à son frère Claude...à ses quatre sœurs Jeanne, Anne, Louise,
2 CONC  Marguerite”[1077].  Seyssel-Crussieu records her marriage contract at Coire priory dated 1 Sep 1425[1078].  Foras records the date of her marriage and a 13 Jul 1437 charter confirming payment of dowry[1079].  Her place of burial 
2 CONC is confirmed by the 20 Sep 1460 testament of her husband.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (contract 1 Sep 1425) as his first wife, JEAN de Seyssel Seigneur de Barjat et de La Rochette, Maréchal de Savoie, son of ANTOINE de Seyssel Baron d’Aix & his wife Jeanne de la Rochette (-1465, bur La Rochette). 
