2 CONT Henri 'le Corgne' de Marle, Chancellor of France, Seignuer de Versigny, Envoy to the Pope in Avignon & to Aragon married Mahaud le Barbier, daughter of Siquart le Barbier, Seigneur de Sauveterre, Advocate of Senlis and Jeanne de M
