1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://archive.org/stream/nobiliaireuniver16sainuoft#page/274/mode/2up
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean Janvre VI, of the name, knight, senor of the Bouchetiere, and of the baldeter, wife, per contract of 21 January 1410, Thomasse Corignolla daughter of Haubert Corignau, Chevalier, Seigneur du Vivier-Estraing, in Angoumois, and
2 CONC  Chalillon in Poitou; (This Thomasse Corignolle was the sister of Louis Corignou, who had married, before 8 May 1438, Marquerette Janvre sister of Jean Janvre VI)-Ingestuur Ds.MG Muller
