1 NAME Lord Louis I Corgnol
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean de Brémond d'Ars, knight, Sr. Ars, de Gimeux, La Motte-Meursac, etc., married, by contract of January 22, 1468 Marguerite Corgnol, daughter of Louis Corgnol, knight, Sr du Vivier, near Ruffec, And of Marguerite Janvre de La B
2 CONC achelière, of whom: 1 ° Charles, who follows; 2 Georges, who married a sister of Artus de Vivonne, Sr. de Pisany, the husband of Catherine de Bremond, on 26 January 1527, at the castle of Balanzac.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Note They had 7 or 8 children. Marguerite married Jean de Bremond d'Ars
2 CONT
2 CONT sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT Individual: http://www.histoirepassion.eu/spip.php?article1154
