1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bonne of Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Bonne of Bourbon (1341 – Château de Mâcon, January 19, 1402) was a daughter of Peter I, Duke of Bourbon and Isabella of Valois and hence a sister of Jeanne de Bourbon.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Count Amadeus VI of Savoy in 1355 in Paris. They had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Amadeus VII of Savoy (1360 - November 1, 1391). He married Bonne of Berry (1365–1435), daughter of Duke John of Berry and a niece of Bonne of Bourbon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis of Savoy (1362 - 1365).
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bonne_of_Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT Bonne of Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
