2 CONT *'''Sir Nicholo Orsini, Count de Nola & Soleto, Senator of Rome, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples1,2,3,4,5
2 CONT *'''M, #18158, b. 27 August 1331
2 CONT *Father	Roberto Orsini, 2nd Count di Nola, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, Monforte, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples2,6,7 d. 15 Jan 1345
2 CONT *Mother	Sueva des Baux2,6,7 d. a 1375
2 CONT *'''     Sir Nicholo Orsini, Count de Nola & Soleto, Senator of Rome, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples was born on 27 August 1331.2,4 He married Maria de Baux''', daughter 
2 CONC of Raymond de Baux, 2nd Count of Soleto, Captain-General of Capitanata and Isabelle d' Eppes, '''circa 1359.8 Sir Nicholo Orsini, Count de Nola & Soleto, Senator of Rome, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, 
2 CONC & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples married Jeanne de Sabran''', daughter of Guillaume de Sabran, 3rd Count d'Ariano and Francisca di Celano, '''before 5 January 1363 at Naples, Italy; They had 3 sons''' (Robert, Count of Pitigliano; 
2 CONC Sir Raimondo, Prince of Tarento, Duke of Andria, Count of Soleto; & Gentile) '''and 2 daughters''' (Sueva, wife of François des Baux, Duke de Andria, Count of Montescaglioso & Squillace; & Beatrice, wife of Luigi Antonio della Rat
2 CONC ta, Count of Caserta).2,4 Sir '''Nicholo Orsini, Count de Nola & Soleto, Senator of Rome, Signore di Atripalda, Bardella, Cantalupo, Cicala, Forino, & Vicovaro, Justiciar of Naples left a will on 14 February 1399.2,6,4
2 CONT *'''Family 1     Maria de Baux''' b. 1340 or 1341
2 CONT *'''Family 2     Jeanne de Sabran''' d. c 1378
2 CONT *'''Children	
2 CONT **Sueva Orsini+2,6,3,4,5 d. a 23 Apr 1422
2 CONT **Roberto Orsini, 4th Count di Nola, Signore di Vicovaro, Roccagiovine, Cantalupo, Nettuno, Bardella, Forino, Boiano, Saturnia, Avella, Montemerano, Atripalda, & Cicala+8,9 b. c 1359, d. 1399
2 CONT **Raimondo Orsini, Prince of Taranto, Duke d'Andria, Comte di Soleto+10 b. c 1365, d. 17 Jan 1406
2 CONT **Caterina Orsini+11 b. c 1370
2 CONT *Citations
