1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.geni.com/people/Guy-II-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Rais/6000000014329892239?through=6000000014329624719 GUY de Laval], son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Guy-I-de-Montmorency-Laval-seigneur-de-Chall
2 CONC ouyau/6000000014329834410?through=6000000014329892239  GUY de Laval “Brumor” Seigneur de Chaloyau] & his second wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Tiphaine-de-Husson/6000000032281754945?through=6000000014329892239  Typhinia de Huss
2 CONC on Dame de Ducey] (-[29 Oct 1415/early 1416], bur Buzay abbey).Guy & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Gilles-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Rais/6000000014329624719 GILLES de Lava]l ([1404/05]-killed Nantes 24 Oct 1440).  Seigneur de Rays.  "Messire René de Rays chevalier” requested “messire 
2 CONC Gilles de Rays baron et seigneur de Rays, frère aisné dudit René, enfans de feu Guy en son vivant seigneur de Rays et de feue Marie de Craon fille de feu messire Jehan de Craon jadis chevalier en son vivant seigneur de la Suze et 
2 CONC de Champtocé et de dame Béatrix de Rochefort sa femme” to finalise the division of their inheritance between them by charter dated 25 Jan 1433 (O.S.), reserving the dower of “dame Anne de Sillé veusve dudit feu seigneur de la Suze
2 CONC ”[369].  Maréchal de France.  Betrothed (contract 4 Jan 1417) to [https://www.geni.com/people/Jeanne-Paynel/6000000016392036851?through=6000000003827681186 JEANNE PayneIl Dame de Hambye], daughter of FOULQUES [IV] Paynel Seigneur 
2 CONC de Hambye et de Bricquebec & his wife Marguerite de Dinan (-1432 or after).  The marriage contract of "Gilles de Retz” and “Jeanne Paynel” was agreed 4 Jan 1416 (O.S.) between “Jean de la Suze” and “Charles de Dinan seigneur de Ch
2 CONC âteaubriant et Marguerite sa fille, mère de Jeanne”[370].  Betrothed (Vannes, Château de l’Hermine 28 Nov 1418) to [https://www.geni.com/people/Beatrix-de-Rohan/6000000219810671831 BEATRIX de Rohan], daughter of ALAIN [IX] de Roha
2 CONC n Seigneur de Porhoët [later Vicomte de Rohan] & his first wife Marguerite de Bretagne.  The marriage contract between "Alain Vicomte de Rohan et Seigneur de Leon et Alain son fils ainé Seigneur de Porhoet...Damoisellle Beatrix fi
2 CONC lle puisnée du dit Sire de Porhoet" and "Messire Jean de Craon Seigneur de la Suze et de Chantocé Tuteur et Garde de Gilles Sire de Rais et de Blazon...le dit Sire de Rais" is dated 28 Nov 1418[371].  
2 CONT m (contract 30 Nov 1420) as her first husband, [https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-de-Thouars/6000000014329885763?through=6000000014329624719 CATHERINE de Thouars], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Milon-de-Thouars-de-P
2 CONC ouzanges-Tiffauges/6000000014329611804?through=6000000014329885763 MILON [II] de Thouars Seigneur de Pouzauges] & his wife --- (-2 Dec 1462).  She married secondly [https://www.geni.com/people/Jean-de-Vend%C3%B4me-Vidame-de-Chartr
2 CONC es-Seigneur-de-Lassay/6000000219810803844 Jean de Vendôme Vidame de Chartres, Seigneur de Lassay.]  Gilles & his wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT >a)         [https://www.geni.com/people/Marie-de-Montmorency-Laval-de-Rais/6000000020002741745?through=6000000014329624719 MARIE de Laval] .  Dame de Rays.  m firstly (14 Jun 1442) [https://www.geni.com/people/Prigent-VII-de-Co%C
2 CONC 3%ABtivy/6000000020003932087 PREGENT [VII] de Coëtivy Seigneur de Coëtivy], son of ALAIN [III] Seigneur de Coëtivy & his wife Catherine de Chastel (-killed siege of Cherbourg 20 Jun 1450).  Seigneur de Rays, de iure uxoris.  m sec
2 CONC ondly [https://www.geni.com/people/Andr%C3%A9-de-Montfort-Laval-seigneur-de-Loh%C3%A9ac/6000000009710292409 ANDRE de Laval Seigneur de Loheac], son of GUY [XIII] Seigneur de Laval & his wife Anne de Laval (-Vitré 1 Nov 1457).  Sei
2 CONC gneur de Rays, de iure uxoris. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Ren%C3%A9-de-Montmorency-Laval-baron-de-Retz/6000000016700527962?through=6000000014329624719 RENE de Laval] (-1474).  Seigneur de la Suze.  
