1 CONC  married Clovis, King of the Franks, in 493 and had with him five children. She wasthe person primarily responsible for Clovis' conversion to Christianity, and,therefore, the conversion of all of France. At Clovis' death in 511, C
1 CONC lotilda went into a monastery at Tours where she stayed until her death in 545. She wascanonized a few years after her death, and her traditional feast day is June 3." ---------------------------------------- 1  NAME St. Clothilda
