1 CONC  youngest and last surviving son of Clovis. Founded St. Medard Church at Soissons. RC: Clothaire I, King of Soissons, 511; King of Orleans, 524; King of France, 558-561. K: Clothaire I, King of Franks and of Soissons. Collins: Clo
