1 CONT Daughter of King Clovis I and Queen Clotilda. She was married off by her brothers to Amalaric, King of the Visigoths, who mistreated her because she was a Catholic (the Visigothic rulers were Arian). She sent to her brother King C
1 CONC hildebert of Paris for aide, and he quickly had Amalaric killed and asked his sister to return to Paris with him. For some reason Chrotilda died on the journey.[Fix.FTW]
