1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Cheribert was a nobleman in the ancient Gaulish province of Neustria during the reign of King Dagobert I dying before the year 636. He is the oldest known ancestor of the House of Capet. His son, Chrodobertus, succeeded him in his
1 CONC  titles when he died.
1 CONT
