1 CONT Nerman, Birger. Det svenska rikets uppkomst. Generalstabens litagrafiska anstalt: Stockholm. 1925. 
1 CONT Rivers, Theodore John. Laws of the Salian and Ripuarian Franks. New York: AMS Press, 1986. 
1 CONT Rolfe, J.C., trans, Ammianus Marcellinus. Cambridge, MA: Harvard University Press, 1950. 
