1 CONT king of Soissons. He was succeeded by his sons, Theodebert II and Theodoric
1 CONT II. Power struggles eveywhere, but when his mother, Brunhild, tried to make
1 CONT the son of Childebert II King of Austrasia later on, because of a tyrannous
