0 @N6000000000437064232@ NOTE Name Prefix:<NPFX> King Name Suffix:<NSFX> Ii, Of The Visigoths "ALARIC II. (d. 507), eighth king of the Visigoths in Spain, succeeded his father Euric? orEvaric in 485. His dominions not only included the whole of Spain except it
