1 CONT II, whose right to the throne Childebert had usurped, and of Wulfoald, mayor
1 CONT of the palace. He later became master of Neustria and Burgundy, as well as of
1 CONT Austrasia. Lacking political ability, he was the last Merovingian to attempt
1 CONT to exercise authority. Hostility to Austrasia led to his assassination in 675.
